---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE } from "../lib/site";
---
<Base title="Contact – Enshrouded Builder" description="Report a build error, suggest a build or get in touch with EnshroudedBuilder.com.">
  <article class="wrap pt-14 prose-game max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="text-4xl">Contact</h1>
    <p>Found a number that changed in a patch, a broken link or a bug in the planner? Want a build added? Open an issue on our public GitHub repository. It is the fastest way to reach us, and every report is tracked.</p>
    <p><a class="btn btn-flame no-underline !text-[#22130a]" href={`${SITE.repo}/issues/new`} rel="noopener">Open an issue on GitHub</a></p>
    <p>When you report a build error, tell us the game version you play on and which number looks wrong. A screenshot of the in-game skill tooltip helps a lot.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
